WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:05.700
I'm pretty cynical by nature, but the last
two months have seen how I don't know if it's

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:10.470
30 percent or 40 percent of the country has
been dealing with Corona virus.

00:00:10.470 --> 00:00:15.670
It's really made me lose like even more faith
in humanity than I had already lost, at least

00:00:15.670 --> 00:00:17.280
American humanity.

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:23.180
We already did a story on the bonus show about
how one third of the country believes coronavirus

00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:27.830
was created deliberately rather than evolving
as viruses do.

00:00:27.830 --> 00:00:29.860
And this is already very, very bad.

00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:36.629
And we increasingly now have the sort of liberty
crowd, the people that fetishize a myopic

00:00:36.629 --> 00:00:42.999
version of what freedom is starting to protest,
that we must open the country.

00:00:42.999 --> 00:00:47.569
Many of them have even been gathering in large
groups in order to demand that the country

00:00:47.569 --> 00:00:48.569
be opened.

00:00:48.569 --> 00:00:52.339
And one such rally happened in Michigan yesterday
and other one happening, I believe, today

00:00:52.339 --> 00:00:53.339
in Kentucky.

00:00:53.339 --> 00:00:54.339
Possibly.

00:00:54.339 --> 00:00:57.180
But all of today's videos are from yesterday
in Michigan.

00:00:57.180 --> 00:00:59.430
And Michigan is having a real problem with
coronavirus.

00:00:59.430 --> 00:01:04.460
Michigan is in the top eight states in cases
per capita.

00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:09.180
Michigan is in the top four states in deaths
per capita.

00:01:09.180 --> 00:01:11.009
And they're not doing that much testing.

00:01:11.009 --> 00:01:15.479
They're only testing 30 second per capita
in the United States.

00:01:15.479 --> 00:01:18.450
And of course, many states simply do not have
tests.

00:01:18.450 --> 00:01:21.530
It's beyond many states to be able to do more
testing.

00:01:21.530 --> 00:01:27.049
The point is high death per capita, low testing
per capita in Michigan.

00:01:27.049 --> 00:01:29.090
People have to stay the hell home.

00:01:29.090 --> 00:01:31.680
So here are protesters gathering in huge groups.

00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:33.180
Now you're going to hear if you're not watching.

00:01:33.180 --> 00:01:35.590
I'll tell you some of what you're going to
hear.

00:01:35.590 --> 00:01:40.340
You're going to hear screams of lock her up,
referring to Michigan Governor Gretchen Whitmer.

00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:43.259
You're going to hear screams of recall wittmer.

00:01:43.259 --> 00:01:45.109
You'll hear USA USA chants.

00:01:45.109 --> 00:01:49.750
And, of course, what you will see if you're
watching as a huge crowd of people when we're

00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:53.090
trying to fight a virus that spreads through
droplet contagion.

00:01:53.090 --> 00:01:57.859
Take a look.

00:01:57.859 --> 00:02:19.210
Instead, I hear in American.

00:02:19.210 --> 00:02:30.860
I hear interviews with two people, one guy
crying about being unable to get lawn fertilizer

00:02:30.860 --> 00:02:37.140
and a woman complaining about not being able
to dye her gray roots, bending down to show

00:02:37.140 --> 00:02:39.590
how the roots are tragically coming in.

00:02:39.590 --> 00:02:41.650
I can't go between those houses.

00:02:41.650 --> 00:02:42.680
You can't buy paint.

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:44.150
You can't buy a law.

00:02:44.150 --> 00:02:47.290
You can't buy lawn fertilizer, grass seed
or what?

00:02:47.290 --> 00:02:48.290
Come on.

00:02:48.290 --> 00:02:49.290
All statewide.

00:02:49.290 --> 00:02:50.290
Really?

00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:51.290
You know, it's time for our state to be opened
up.

00:02:51.290 --> 00:02:58.990
We're tired of not being able to buy the things
that we need.

00:02:58.990 --> 00:03:00.830
Go to the hairdressers, get her hair done.

00:03:00.830 --> 00:03:05.180
So, I mean, listen, the guy who's crying about
fertilizer, if you're that desperate for some

00:03:05.180 --> 00:03:10.710
manure, just watch trumps daily press briefings
