00:03:10.710 --> 00:03:13.210
But this is really, really crazy.

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:15.880
First of all, you know the woman with the
hair dye.

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:21.470
Twenty five hundred people died in the United
States on Wednesday this week from Corona

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:22.470
virus.

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:25.850
This is the most in one day in any country
