00:03:34.820 --> 00:03:37.980
going on in their states because the guy lot
of crying about manure.

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:39.110
I looked into it.

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:41.350
Hardware stores are open in Michigan.

00:03:41.350 --> 00:03:42.380
They will give you fertilizer.

00:03:42.380 --> 00:03:44.710
They'll even bring you have to call ahead
