00:03:51.360 --> 00:03:55.350
The idea that, you know, he's crying because
he can't get fertilizer, you can get fertilizer.

00:03:55.350 --> 00:03:56.920
I don't know if he has access to the Internet.

00:03:56.920 --> 00:04:01.410
So this is the epitome of the ugly side of
America.

00:04:01.410 --> 00:04:06.870
And it is not lost on me that both of these
individuals appear to be in higher risk groups

00:04:06.870 --> 00:04:12.420
based on their age groups that should really
be staying home right now, completely entitled,

00:04:12.420 --> 00:04:16.000
completely lacking in understanding of basic
