00:04:45.230 --> 00:04:47.330
Let it rip, so to speak.

00:04:47.330 --> 00:04:49.380
But they do put others at risk.

00:04:49.380 --> 00:04:52.170
People who do understand what's going on.

00:04:52.170 --> 00:04:59.160
Recognize that those people are putting at
risk people in a position where they may get

00:04:59.160 --> 00:05:00.860
the virus and die.

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:04.870
Their actions don't only affect themselves,
they affect everybody around them.

00:05:04.870 --> 00:05:08.170
So we have to act collectively here to keep
people safe.

00:05:08.170 --> 00:05:12.520
They will never change their minds until they
end their loved ones get sick.

00:05:12.520 --> 00:05:15.940
And by then it's going to be told too late,
